stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Detected: case_created / breach_signal_received
  Detected --> AI_Enrichment: emit BREACH_CASE_CREATED
  AI_Enrichment --> Triaged: ai_suggestion_created / triage_completed
  Triaged --> ValidatedAgainstAppetite: appetite_selected + threshold_evaluated

  ValidatedAgainstAppetite --> Escalated: escalation_required
  ValidatedAgainstAppetite --> DecisionRecorded: escalation_not_required

  Escalated --> DecisionRecorded: decision_submitted

  DecisionRecorded --> DecisionApproved: approvals_complete + sod_pass
  DecisionApproved --> ActionPlanActive: actions_created

  ActionPlanActive --> Monitoring: actions_in_progress
  Monitoring --> Closed: actions_completed + evidence_complete

  Closed --> [*]

  note right of DecisionApproved
    High severity requires BU Risk Owner approval.
    SoD: creator cannot approve their own decision.
  end note
